  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2404\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.38px;\">A negative smear&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2403\">does not completely exclude malignancy</strong>.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10.38px;\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2519\">\n<p data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2519\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.38px;\">Further evaluation with <strong data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2483\">cell block, immunocytochemistry (ICC), or biopsy</strong> is recommended in suspicious cases.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10.38px;\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2625\">\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2625\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.38px;\">Interpret findings in conjunction with <strong data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2581\">clinical history</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2594\">imaging</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2624\">biochemical analysis</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
